{%- comment -%}
  Floating chrome & modals — ported from app.js overlaysHTML().
  WhatsApp float, referral modal, Mix-into-Spray wizard.
  Wired by app.js (openReferral/closeMix/waChat).

  The in-theme "Find My Scent" concierge was removed: chat is handled by the
  Chizy AI chatbot app, which injects its own launcher. Every Find My Scent
  entry point now opens /pages/find-my-scent (the quiz).
{%- endcomment -%}

